  "body": "I'm not a 100% sure still, but the more I read, the more it seems like \"create a script\" has a side effect in step 7. It invokes \"report an error\" which ends up dispatching an event of sorts on the global.\n\nHowever, `importScripts()` seems to expect it to rethrow.\n\nThis came up in #166 which does some refactoring in that general area.\n",
